---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/community-outreach.html
headline: Community Outreach
deck: A vocation to share the all-encompassing love of God with the parish we serve — through practical action alongside our neighbours.
intro_heading: Community Organising
intro_image: /assets/feedback/community-organising.jpg
intro_image_alt: Community organising at Emmanuel
intro_paragraphs:
  - text: "Emmanuel and St Cuthbert's are members of <a href=\"https://www.citizensuk.org/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Citizens UK</a>."
  - text: "We partner with local churches, mosques, synagogues, schools, universities and community projects to campaign on issues that concern our communities. North London Citizens campaigns have included: the living wage, youth welfare, support for refugees, and tackling homelessness on our streets."
projects:
  - title: C4WS Night Shelter at Emmanuel
    body: |-
      From November to February we partner with the charity <a href="https://c4wshomelessproject.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">C4WS</a> to host a weekly night shelter for up to 16 guests who are homeless. Guests arrive in time for a freshly cooked hot meal. They're able to take a hot shower and spend the rest of the evening playing games, chatting, resting or making use of the church wifi.

      We have a team of volunteers who help with the different shifts: set up, prepare the meal, host the evening, and sleeping overnight in the church.
    image: ''
    image_alt: ''
  - title: Emmanuel Connections
    body: Emmanuel Connections is a partnership with Hampstead School, the secondary school in our parish. Through this collaboration, the church community helps to facilitate work experience placements, careers talks and workshops at school, as well as setting up 1-1 mentoring between students and people at different stages of their chosen career.
    image: /assets/feedback/emmanuel-school.jpg
    image_alt: Students and mentors at Hampstead School
  - title: FoodCycle Lunch
    body: A weekly FoodCycle Lunch is held at St Cuthbert's on Saturdays at 1pm. This gives us the privilege of welcoming many from the surrounding communities into our building to share in food and fellowship. The friendly and homely atmosphere has proved extremely popular, and our lunch is now the largest FoodCycle lunch in London!
    image: /assets/cms/site-images/community-outreach-new.jpg
    image_alt: Volunteers and guests at the FoodCycle lunch
  - title: Repair Club
    body: On the first and third Mondays of each month, the Kilburn Community Repair Club is held at 6:30pm at St Cuthbert's. This club allows the local community to bring small appliances to the group to learn how to get them repaired. This is a wonderful initiative which both saves money and helps stop more appliances going to landfill.
    image: ''
    image_alt: ''
  - title: Gardening Club
    body: Saturday mornings at St Cuthbert's and at Emmanuel — a varied group of experienced and novice gardeners looking after the garden as well as growing fruit, vegetables and herbs. A great opportunity to enjoy green space, meet new people, and take home some home-grown produce.
    image: ''
    image_alt: ''
  - title: Mitzvah Day
    body: We are proud to be working in partnership with our friends at Hampstead Synagogue and the JW3 Centre on Finchley Road in collecting for Mitzvah Day each year. We collect food and toiletries for our local food banks in Camden and for the work of the C4WS Winter Night Shelter in Emmanuel Church.
    image: ''
    image_alt: ''
  - title: West Hampstead Community Food Hub
    body: We have a collection point for the West Hampstead Community Food Hub in both entrances to the church. Food is collected on Fridays and contributes to the WH Foodhub, which runs out of Sidings Community Centre on Saturday mornings.
    image: /assets/feedback/foodhub-outreach.jpg
    image_alt: Food donations collected for the West Hampstead Community Food Hub
help_heading: Lend a hand
help_body: Every project here runs on people giving a little time — cooking a meal, mentoring a student, tending the garden. Tell us what you would enjoy and we will find you a place.
help_link_label: Get in touch
aside_heading: Drop off a donation
aside_body: Non-perishable food can be left at our collection points any time the church is open. Collections are made every Friday.
aside_image: /assets/cms/site-images/food-bank.jpg
aside_image_alt: Food donations collected at Emmanuel
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>Community Outreach — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
<style>
  .co-project { margin-top: 38px; }
  .co-project:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .co-project h3 { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .co-project__media { aspect-ratio: 16/10; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .co-project__media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <section class="em-pagehead em-pagehead--band em-pagehead--plain">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="community-outreach.html">Get Involved</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Community Outreach</span></div>
      <h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="headline" data-type="span">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="deck" data-editable="text" data-prop="deck" data-type="text">{{ deck }}</p>

    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--fs-h2);font-weight:var(--fw-medium);color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 18px;letter-spacing:-0.01em" data-editable="text" data-prop="intro_heading" data-type="span">{{ intro_heading }}</h2>
        {% if intro_image %}
        <div class="em-well" style="aspect-ratio:16/10;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:720px">
          <img src="{{ intro_image }}" alt="{{ intro_image_alt }}" />
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div data-editable="array" data-prop="intro_paragraphs">
        {% for para in intro_paragraphs %}
          <p{% if loop.first %} class="em-lead"{% endif %} data-editable="array-item">
            <span data-editable="text" data-prop="text" data-type="html">{{ (para.text if para.text else para) | safe }}</span>
          </p>
        {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <div data-editable="array" data-prop="projects">
        {% for project in projects %}
          <div class="co-project" data-editable="array-item">
            <h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="title" data-type="span">{{ project.title }}</h3>
            {% if project.image %}
            <div class="em-well co-project__media">
              <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.image_alt }}" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div data-editable="text" data-prop="body" data-type="html">
              {% for para in project.body.split('\n\n') %}<p>{{ para | trim | safe }}</p>{% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
        </div>

      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <p class="big" data-editable="text" data-prop="help_heading" data-type="span">{{ help_heading }}</p>
          <p data-editable="text" data-prop="help_body" data-type="text">{{ help_body }}</p>
          <a href="contact.html" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-top:4px">{{ help_link_label }}</a>
        </div>
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <p class="big" data-editable="text" data-prop="aside_heading" data-type="span">{{ aside_heading }}</p>
          <p data-editable="text" data-prop="aside_body" data-type="text">{{ aside_body }}</p>
        </div>
        {% if aside_image %}
        <div class="em-well" style="aspect-ratio:4/3">
          <img src="{{ aside_image }}" alt="{{ aside_image_alt }}" />
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
